{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "fr",
  "language_raw": "French",
  "source": "message/dat/French/script/class_b_05.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/class_b_05.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_01",
      "hash64": "33E9DC7A35C4B487",
      "text": "Bonjour tout le monde. J’espère que\\nvous vous êtes remis du contrôle partiel.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_02",
      "hash64": "33E9DD7A35C4B63A",
      "text": "Il va sans dire que certains ont eu de meilleurs\\nrésultats que d’autres, mais j’ai bien vu que\\r\\nvous avez tous fait de votre mieux. Bravo ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_03",
      "hash64": "33E9DE7A35C4B7ED",
      "text": "J’ai été particulièrement heureuse de voir\\nque personne n’a échoué.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_04",
      "hash64": "33E9D77A35C4AC08",
      "text": "J’aime à penser que c’est parce que j’ai su\\nvous transmettre mon amour des nombres.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_05",
      "hash64": "33E9D87A35C4ADBB",
      "text": "Mais attention, nous n’en sommes encore\\nqu’à la moitié du programme. Il nous reste\\r\\nencore beaucoup à faire ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_06",
      "hash64": "33E9D97A35C4AF6E",
      "text": "Mais d’ailleurs, outre vos connaissances, il y a\\nautre chose qui peut « beaucoup » augmenter.\\c\\nJe veux parler des stats des Pokémon, bien sûr ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_07",
      "hash64": "33E9DA7A35C4B121",
      "text": "Pendant les combats, elles peuvent en effet\\naugmenter, ou au contraire, baisser.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_08",
      "hash64": "33E9D37A35C4A53C",
      "text": "Par exemple, lorsqu’un Pokémon utilise\\nla capacité Rengorgement, cela fait augmenter\\r\\nson Attaque et son Attaque Spéciale d’un rang.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_09",
      "hash64": "33E9D47A35C4A6EF",
      "text": "Et lorsque l’Attaque ou l’Attaque Spéciale\\naugmente d’un rang, cela entraîne une hausse\\r\\ndes dégâts de 50 %.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_10",
      "hash64": "33ED617A35C7CC5D",
      "text": "Si le Pokémon utilise à nouveau Rengorgement,\\ncela augmenterait encore ses stats d’un rang.\\c\\nOn obtiendrait donc une hausse des dégâts\\nde 100 %. Concrètement, c’est comme s’il avait\\r\\nutilisé deux fois la même capacité d’un coup.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 232,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_11",
      "hash64": "33ED607A35C7CAAA",
      "text": "La capacité Danse Lames, elle, augmente\\ndirectement l’Attaque de deux rangs.\\c\\nCela signifie donc que vous pouvez doubler vos\\ndégâts en une seule utilisation de cette capacité.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 177,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_12",
      "hash64": "33ED5F7A35C7C8F7",
      "text": "Utiliser Danse Lames deux fois revient à parler\\nd’une hausse de l’Attaque de quatre rangs.\\c\\nPar combien les dégâts du Pokémon seraient-ils\\ndonc multipliés ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "D13C43E9A9C1718D",
      "text": "Par deux.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "D13C40E9A9C16C74",
      "text": "Par trois.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "D13C41E9A9C16E27",
      "text": "Par quatre.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "8B8E0E71C2F5CEC0",
      "text": "La question n’était pas facile, en effet.\\c\\nCe serait la bonne réponse, s’il était question\\nde Rengorgement...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "8B8E1171C2F5D3D9",
      "text": "Bravo, ce n’était pas une question facile !\\nTu m’impressionnes, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "8B8E1071C2F5D226",
      "text": "La question n’était pas facile, en effet.\\c\\nL’important est de bien retenir que ce n’est pas\\nparce que l’Attaque augmente de quatre rangs\\r\\nque les dégâts seront multipliés par quatre.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 186,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_13",
      "hash64": "33ED5E7A35C7C744",
      "text": "Comme je vous l’ai dit, lorsque l’Attaque ou\\nl’Attaque Spéciale augmente d’un rang, cela\\r\\nsignifie que les dégâts augmentent de 50 %.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_14",
      "hash64": "33ED5D7A35C7C591",
      "text": "Ainsi, avec une augmentation de quatre rangs,\\ncela correspondrait à une hausse des dégâts\\r\\nde 4 × 50 %, soit 200 %.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_15",
      "hash64": "33ED5C7A35C7C3DE",
      "text": "En considérant que les dégâts de base sont de\\n100 %, en additionnant les 200 % obtenus\\r\\ngrâce à Danse Lames, on arrive à 300 %.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_16",
      "hash64": "33ED5B7A35C7C22B",
      "text": "En d’autres termes, les dégâts qu’infligera\\nle Pokémon avec les prochaines capacités\\r\\nseront multipliés par trois.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_17",
      "hash64": "33ED5A7A35C7C078",
      "text": "Bien entendu, d’autres facteurs peuvent entrer en\\njeu, comme les affinités de types ou les critiques.\\c\\nGardez donc bien à l’esprit que même une\\naugmentation modeste des stats peut finir\\r\\npar faire une grande différence.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 187,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 223,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_18",
      "hash64": "33ED597A35C7BEC5",
      "text": "À propos, si une stat « augmente », cela signifie\\nqu’elle augmente simplement d’un rang.\\c\\nLorsqu’elle « augmente beaucoup », cela veut\\ndire qu’elle gagne deux rangs supplémentaires.\\c\\nEt enfin, si elle « augmente énormément »,\\ncela correspond à trois rangs supplémentaires.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 276,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_19",
      "hash64": "33ED587A35C7BD12",
      "text": "De plus, certains objets uniquement utilisables\\nen combat peuvent augmenter les stats.\\c\\nPar exemple l’Attaque + ou l’Atq. Spé. +\\naugmentent beaucoup leurs stats respectives.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 175,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_20",
      "hash64": "33F0C77A35CAAF86",
      "text": "Ça alors, est-il déjà l’heure ? J’ai l’impression\\nque les cours finissent toujours trop vite...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_b_05_math_21",
      "hash64": "33F0C87A35CAB139",
      "text": "Le cours d’aujourd’hui était un peu plus difficile\\nque d’habitude, alors je compte sur vous pour...\\r\\nbeaucoup augmenter votre rythme de révision ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
